Network activity on the dashboard: rates in kbit/s over the real poll
interval (formatRate() takes kbit/s; it got KiB/s over a fixed 3 s),
/proc/net/dev parsed at the colon (big counters follow it without a
space, which shifted the columns), a VLAN parent not counted twice,
the canvas sized once visible and the scale written on the graph.

